  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccd9b444b5e2cb8b77f1c0eb6431fbe40744b4e1bba0837a478fdbf8958647ed",
      "text": "恋爱喜剧电视剧的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bf2ad36ca08200f946a232c7db2dc6d44ad438468010e100b5d97b6d1e7c874",
      "text": "“哎，被那个女孩子告白了？\n太好了呢。你不是一直说喜欢她吗”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b206e55ade0aeb0e3cd57b444dd2b96f4f59c5c82dd16e7554fe9c267dd6bf3f",
      "text": "“所以你想商量什么？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0be72911c4362dd5b104b7bb592cd4542fece88897a0d5e8e1c229a63330667b",
      "text": "“第一次约会去哪里好……\n那种事情，自己动脑筋去想啦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5447d8f24ef66425cd3571fde3751b1d07fb152b536f572197641a1049da1f8",
      "text": "呼……●●●●プロデューサー，\n刚才的表现怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f42e2d5c5970f35c4b570c984662ce5aa9cf36b57ef7a039a834ef09bb34ca17",
      "text": "每一句台词都倾注了感情。\n表现得越来越好了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b0979ff9b8632ccfeb0249113b38b5fa38b54c8652ffa9d95ae56521ccdffc6",
      "text": "谢谢！我的角色，聪明、体育全能。\n有好多难念的台词、细微语感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac9dddaeb2106bd516663b1f9e4278285c7626afc6ec0c1a537609feedfbc5e",
      "text": "被●●●●プロデューサー\n夸奖了，好开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8f88aefc8d6bb4ba475abe8d6d692234ee73e0f4b348cb21095f09e753acea4",
      "text": "皮埃尔先生拿到剧本之后，\n一直都在非常认真地练习呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a77eca24e264aaa61956d2136e4b7e26c75a0d3fc70c5cd869230819293d89f3",
      "text": "皮埃尔先生的话，没问题的！\n若有我能帮上忙的地方请尽管开口哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9de6ebf6e684f433c7eec89470084a96c3d81947bb67b2c786da26180a4a7ea7",
      "text": "嗯！一直以来谢谢你，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
